---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Businesses · Sawaza" description="Customer accounts, invoices as signed credit sales, loans with a schedule and your monthly books, each signed by the people you deal with." bodyId="page-businesses">
<style is:global>
/* page layout: words beside a drawn app screen */
#page-businesses .duo{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,400px);gap:clamp(32px,6vw,88px);align-items:center}
#page-businesses .duo.flip{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,400px) minmax(0,1fr)}
#page-businesses .duo.flip>.fig{order:-1}
#page-businesses .duo+.duo{margin-top:clamp(56px,8vw,96px)}
#page-businesses .txt h3{font:700 clamp(26px,3.2vw,38px)/1.08 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.025em}
#page-businesses .txt>p:not(.q):not(.sub-h){margin-top:16px;color:var(--dim);font-size:clamp(16px,1.6vw,18px);line-height:1.6;max-width:34em}
#page-businesses .txt>p:not(.q) b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
#page-businesses .txt .tlink{margin-top:22px}
#page-businesses .pts{list-style:none;margin:22px 0 0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:12px;max-width:34em}
#page-businesses .pts li{position:relative;padding-left:22px;color:var(--dim);font-size:16px;line-height:1.55}
#page-businesses .pts li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:.68em;width:10px;height:2px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--gold)}
#page-businesses .pts li b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
#page-businesses .pts small{color:var(--quiet);font-size:14px}
#page-businesses .sub-h{margin-top:28px;font:600 12px/1 var(--body);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--quiet)}
#page-businesses .sub-h+.pts{margin-top:14px}
#page-businesses .stl{list-style:none;counter-reset:st;margin:24px 0 0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:16px;max-width:34em}
#page-businesses .stl li{counter-increment:st;display:grid;grid-template-columns:36px minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px;align-items:start;color:var(--dim);font-size:16px;line-height:1.55}
#page-businesses .stl li::before{content:counter(st);display:grid;place-items:center;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--gold);color:var(--gold);font:700 15px/1 var(--display)}
#page-businesses .stl li b{display:block;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
/* the figure: a caption and a screen drawn in the app's own kit */
#page-businesses .fig{display:grid;gap:10px;justify-items:center;min-width:0}
#page-businesses .fig>*{width:100%;max-width:400px}
#page-businesses .lab{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;font:600 11px/1.3 var(--body);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--quiet)}
#page-businesses .lab .ex{flex:none;font:700 10px/1 var(--body);letter-spacing:.12em;padding:5px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ground);color:var(--quiet);border:1px solid var(--line)}
#page-businesses .deep .lab .ex{background:var(--deep)}
#page-businesses .scr{font-size:14px;border-radius:22px;border:1px solid #2A303C;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -28px rgba(0,0,0,.9);padding-bottom:.6em}
#page-businesses .scr.flush{padding-bottom:0}
#page-businesses .pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(20px,3vw,32px);align-items:start}
#page-businesses .trio{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(18px,2.4vw,28px);align-items:start}
#page-businesses .pair .fig>*,#page-businesses .trio .fig>*{max-width:none}
#page-businesses .after{margin-top:clamp(36px,5vw,56px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px 48px}
#page-businesses .after .pts{margin-top:0}
/* kind cards beside the chooser */
#page-businesses .kinds{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}
#page-businesses .kc{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:20px 20px 18px;display:grid;gap:8px;align-content:start}
#page-businesses .kc h3{font:700 20px/1.2 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.02em}
#page-businesses .kc p{color:var(--dim);font-size:15px;line-height:1.5}
#page-businesses .kc .tlink{font-size:15px;min-height:44px;margin-bottom:-12px}
#page-businesses .kc .n{font:600 11px/1 var(--body);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold)}
#page-businesses .note{margin-top:18px;color:var(--quiet);font-size:14px;max-width:40em}
/* app parts the home draws inside its own sections, redrawn here from the same values */
#page-businesses .app .t-pt{font:700 1.375em/1.15 var(--body);letter-spacing:-.01em;padding:.2em 1rem 0;padding-inline:1em}
#page-businesses .app .t-ln{font-size:.875em;color:var(--a-dim);padding:.35em 1em .7em;line-height:1.45}
#page-businesses .app .kk{margin:0 1em .5em;background:var(--a-surface);border:1px solid var(--a-line);border-radius:1em;padding:.7em .85em}
#page-businesses .app .kk b{display:block;font:600 1em/1.25 var(--body)}
#page-businesses .app .kk small{display:block;font-size:.8125em;color:var(--a-dim);line-height:1.35;margin-top:.15em}
#page-businesses .app .kk.on{border-color:#E3A82B;background:var(--a-goldGround)}
#page-businesses .app .kk.ic{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.4em minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:.75em;align-items:center}
#page-businesses .app .kk.ic>i{width:2.4em;height:2.4em;border-radius:50%;background:var(--a-goldGround);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#E3A82B}
#page-businesses .app .kk.ic>i svg{width:1.2em;height:1.2em}
#page-businesses .app .kk.ic>svg{width:1.25em;height:1.25em;color:var(--a-goldText)}
#page-businesses .app .gbar{display:flex;gap:.7em;align-items:center;padding:.85em 1em .8em;background:rgba(154,165,240,.16);border-bottom:2px solid #9AA5F0;margin-bottom:.4em}
#page-businesses .app .gbar b{display:block;font:700 1.125em/1.2 var(--display);color:#C9CFF7}
#page-businesses .app .gbar span:not(.a-av){display:block;font-size:.8125em;color:var(--a-dim)}
#page-businesses .app .gbar.mv{background:rgba(214,160,224,.14);border-bottom-color:#D2A0E0}
#page-businesses .app .gbar.mv b{color:#EBCDF2}
#page-businesses .app .key{font:700 .6875em/1 var(--body);letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--a-dim);padding:.9em 1em .5em}
#page-businesses .app .pend{font-weight:700;color:var(--a-goldText)}
#page-businesses .app .pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:1.6em;padding:0 .6em;border-radius:99em;background:var(--a-well);font:700 .6875em/1 var(--body);letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--a-dim);margin-left:.45em;vertical-align:.15em}
#page-businesses .app .mem{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.75em minmax(0,1fr);gap:.75em;align-items:center;padding:.6em 1em;position:relative}
#page-businesses .app .mem+.mem::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:4.75em;right:1em;height:1px;background:var(--a-line)}
#page-businesses .app .mem b{font:600 1.0625em/1.25 var(--body)}
#page-businesses .app .mem small{display:block;font-size:.875em;color:var(--a-dim);margin-top:.1em}
#page-businesses .app .a-reg.gone{opacity:.72}
#page-businesses .app .pbh{display:grid;gap:.2em;margin:.2em .8em .4em;padding:.9em 1em;border-radius:1.1em;background:var(--a-surface)}
#page-businesses .app .pbh small{font:700 .75em/1 var(--body);letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--a-dim)}
#page-businesses .app .pbh b{font:700 1.1875em/1.2 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--a-text)}
#page-businesses .app .pbh span{font-size:.8125em;color:var(--a-dim)}
#page-businesses .app .pbr{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:.8em;padding:.6em 1em;border-top:1px solid var(--a-line)}
#page-businesses .app .pbr b{display:block;font:600 .9375em/1.3 var(--body);color:var(--a-text)}
#page-businesses .app .pbr small{display:block;font-size:.78em;color:var(--a-dim)}
#page-businesses .app .pbr .r{text-align:right}
#page-businesses .app .pbr .r b{font-weight:700;font-size:.875em}
#page-businesses .app .pbr .in{color:var(--a-in)}
#page-businesses .app .pbr.wait{opacity:.62}
#page-businesses .app .pbr.wait small svg{width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-.15em;margin-right:.25em}
#page-businesses .app .ch{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto auto minmax(0,1fr) auto;align-items:center;gap:.6em;padding:.4em 1em .7em}
#page-businesses .app .ch .back,#page-businesses .app .ch .more{width:1.4em;height:1.4em;color:var(--a-text)}
#page-businesses .app .ch .a-av{width:3em;height:3em}
#page-businesses .app .ch b{display:block;font:700 1.35em/1.1 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--a-text)}
#page-businesses .app .ch div span{display:block;font-size:.8125em;color:var(--a-dim);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
#page-businesses .app .tabs{display:flex;gap:1.4em;padding:0 1.1em;border-bottom:1px solid var(--a-line);margin-bottom:.3em}
#page-businesses .app .tabs span{padding:.55em 0 .65em;font:600 .9375em/1 var(--body);color:var(--a-dim);white-space:nowrap}
#page-businesses .app .tabs span.on{color:var(--a-text);box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 #E3A82B}
#page-businesses .app .owes{display:grid;gap:.15em;padding:.6em 1em .8em}
#page-businesses .app .owes b{font:600 1em/1.3 var(--body);color:var(--a-text)}
#page-businesses .app .owes strong{font:700 1.25em/1.2 var(--body)}
#page-businesses .app .owes .in{color:var(--a-in)}#page-businesses .app .owes .out{color:var(--a-out)}
#page-businesses .app .owes span{font-size:.875em;color:var(--a-dim)}
#page-businesses .app .sch{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto auto;gap:.9em;align-items:baseline;padding:.55em 1em;border-top:1px solid var(--a-line);font-size:.9375em}
#page-businesses .app .key+.sch{border-top:0}
#page-businesses .app .sch .num{font-weight:700}
#page-businesses .app .sch em{font-style:normal;font:600 .8125em/1 var(--body);color:var(--a-quiet);min-width:4.8em;text-align:right}
#page-businesses .app .sch em.p{color:var(--a-in)}#page-businesses .app .sch em.d{color:var(--a-goldText)}
#page-businesses .app .lf{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.5em;margin:.2em 1em .4em;background:var(--a-surface);border-radius:1.125em;padding:.9em 1em}
#page-businesses .app .lf small{display:block;font-size:.8125em;color:var(--a-dim)}
#page-businesses .app .lf b{display:block;font:700 1.0625em/1.2 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-top:.2em;white-space:nowrap}
#page-businesses .app .lt{font-size:.875em;color:var(--a-dim);padding:0 1em .5em}
#page-businesses .app .menu{margin:.4em .8em .2em;background:var(--a-surface);border-radius:1.125em;padding:.3em 0 .4em;box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.4),0 20px 44px -10px rgba(0,0,0,.6),inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.06)}
#page-businesses .app .menu .mem{padding:.55em .9em}
#page-businesses .app .menu .mem.on{background:var(--a-lift)}
#page-businesses .app .chips{display:flex;gap:.5em;flex-wrap:wrap}
#page-businesses .app .chips span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:2.25em;padding:0 .95em;border-radius:99em;background:var(--a-surface);border:1px solid var(--a-line);font:600 .875em/1 var(--body);color:var(--a-dim)}
#page-businesses .app .chips span.on{background:#E3A82B;border-color:#E3A82B;color:#0F1219}
#page-businesses .app .a-dp.on-in{background:rgba(99,192,139,.12);border-color:rgba(99,192,139,.45);color:var(--a-in)}
#page-businesses .app .a-amt.in{color:var(--a-in)}
#page-businesses .app .inv{margin:.5em 1em .3em;background:var(--a-surface);border-radius:1.125em;padding:1em;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.04),0 6px 15px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.45)}
#page-businesses .app .inv .iw{display:flex;gap:.7em;align-items:center}
#page-businesses .app .inv .iw b{display:block;font:700 1.125em/1.2 var(--display)}
#page-businesses .app .inv .iw span:not(.a-av){display:block;font-size:.8125em;color:var(--a-dim)}
#page-businesses .app .inv p{font-size:.9375em;color:var(--a-dim);line-height:1.45;margin-top:.75em}
#page-businesses .app .inv .a-two{margin-top:.9em}
#page-businesses .app .a-cbtns svg{width:1.1em;height:1.1em}
@media (max-width:1099px){#page-businesses .trio{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
@media (max-width:900px){
  #page-businesses .duo,#page-businesses .duo.flip{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
  #page-businesses .duo.flip>.fig{order:2}
  #page-businesses .fig{justify-items:start}
  #page-businesses .after{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
}
@media (max-width:760px){#page-businesses .pair,#page-businesses .trio{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}#page-businesses .pair .fig>*,#page-businesses .trio .fig>*{max-width:400px}}
@media (max-width:560px){#page-businesses .kinds{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}#page-businesses .scr{font-size:13px}}
#page-businesses main .tlink{min-height:44px}
#page-businesses .txt h3{margin-top:18px}

#page-businesses .app .a-debt .top span strong{color:inherit}
#page-businesses .cap{font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--dim);max-width:none}
#page-businesses .chain{gap:clamp(36px,4.5vw,56px)}
#page-businesses .chain .scr{font-size:13px}
#page-businesses .chain .fig{position:relative}
#page-businesses .chain .fig+.fig::before{content:"\2192";content:"\2192"/"";position:absolute;left:calc(-1*clamp(36px,4.5vw,56px)/2 - .5em);top:42%;width:1em;color:var(--gold);font:700 24px/1 var(--display)}
#page-businesses .point{max-width:36em;margin:clamp(32px,4vw,48px) auto 0;text-align:center;font:600 clamp(18px,2vw,24px)/1.4 var(--display);color:var(--ink)}
#page-businesses .point b{color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}
#page-businesses .h2 em,#page-businesses h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--gold)}
#page-businesses .sub.own{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
#page-businesses .picks{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:10px}
#page-businesses .picks a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:15px}
#page-businesses .picks a:hover{border-color:var(--gold)}
#page-businesses .pick-l{margin-top:22px;font:600 12px/1 var(--body);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--quiet)}
#page-businesses .page-hero .cta-row{margin-top:22px}
#page-businesses .two-p{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(20px,4vw,56px)}
#page-businesses .two-p p{color:var(--dim);font-size:clamp(16px,1.6vw,18px);line-height:1.6}
#page-businesses .two-p b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
#page-businesses .two-p a,#page-businesses .rest a:not(.tlink){color:var(--gold);display:inline-block;min-height:44px;line-height:44px}
#page-businesses .beta{margin-top:24px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);color:var(--dim);font-size:15px;max-width:40em}
#page-businesses .beta b{color:var(--ink);margin-right:.4em}
#page-businesses .moment .sec-head{text-align:center;margin-inline:auto}
#page-businesses .moment .sec-head .lede{margin-inline:auto}
#page-businesses .moment .sec-head .h2{margin-inline:auto;max-width:18em}
#page-businesses .moment .scr{font-size:15px}
#page-businesses .moment .pair{max-width:1020px;margin-inline:auto}
#page-businesses .moment .trio{max-width:1240px;margin-inline:auto}
#page-businesses .moment .pts.one{margin:clamp(32px,4vw,48px) auto 0;max-width:38em}
#page-businesses .moment .beta{margin-inline:auto;text-align:center}
#page-businesses .rest{margin:24px auto 0;max-width:38em;color:var(--dim);font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;text-align:center}
#page-businesses section[id]{scroll-margin-top:72px}
#page-businesses .app .cbar{margin:.5em .875em .3em;height:6px;border-radius:99em;background:var(--a-well);overflow:hidden}
#page-businesses .app .cbar i{display:block;height:100%;background:#E3A82B;border-radius:99em}
#page-businesses .app .showall{text-align:right;padding:.6em .875em .2em;font:600 .8125em/1 var(--body);color:var(--a-goldText)}
#page-businesses .app .a-cyc .a-cbtns{padding:.6em .875em 0}
@media (max-width:860px){#page-businesses .chain{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}#page-businesses .chain .fig+.fig::before{content:"\2193";content:"\2193"/"";left:50%;top:calc(-1*clamp(36px,4.5vw,56px)/2 - .6em);transform:translateX(-50%)}#page-businesses .chain .fig{justify-items:center}#page-businesses .two-p{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}}
#page-businesses .one-p p{color:var(--dim);font-size:clamp(16px,1.6vw,18px);line-height:1.6;max-width:44em}#page-businesses .one-p b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
#page-businesses .sec>.wrap>.rest{margin-top:20px}
@media (max-width:360px){#page-businesses .app .a-quote b{white-space:normal;overflow:visible}#page-businesses .app .ch div span{white-space:normal}}
#page-businesses .fig>.pcrop{width:fit-content;max-width:100%}
#page-businesses .fig>.pcrop.from-bottom{width:calc(22.5em + 18px)}
#page-businesses .fig:has(.pcrop){justify-items:center}
#page-businesses .fig:has(.pcrop)>.lab{max-width:318px}
#page-businesses .kept{display:grid;gap:18px;max-width:40em;justify-items:start}
#page-businesses .kept>p{color:var(--dim);font-size:clamp(16px,1.6vw,18px);line-height:1.6}
#page-businesses .kept .pts{margin-top:0}
#page-businesses .kept .pts li{color:var(--ink)}
#page-businesses .kept .roles b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
</style>
<section class="page-hero" id="top">
  <svg class="watermark" viewBox="0 0 1000 1000" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M113.394,690.625 L237.500,690.625 A184.375,190.625 0 0 0 421.875,500.000 A340.625,334.375 0 0 1 762.500,165.625 L810.606,165.625 A25.000,25.000 0 0 0 826.950,121.712 A500.000,500.000 0 0 0 12.163,609.619 A103.750,103.750 0 0 0 113.394,690.625 Z"/><path d="M886.606,309.375 L762.500,309.375 A184.375,190.625 0 0 0 578.125,500.000 A340.625,334.375 0 0 1 237.500,834.375 L189.394,834.375 A25.000,25.000 0 0 0 173.050,878.288 A500.000,500.000 0 0 0 987.837,390.381 A103.750,103.750 0 0 0 886.606,309.375 Z"/></g></svg>
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <p class="q">For businesses</p>
      <h1 data-new="1">Credit your customers <em>sign for</em>.</h1>
      <p class="sub">Each customer’s account, signed by them, and your books for the month.</p>
      <p class="sub own" data-new="1">Your books stay true even when you are not at the counter.</p>
      <div class="cta-row"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="/#get">Get the app</a><a class="tlink" href="/how-it-works">See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="fig" role="img" aria-label="Screen of Mukasa Traders’ record with Sarah: two invoices, UGX 800,000 and 260,000 left, shown in green as owed to the business.">
      <p class="lab" aria-hidden="true">Mukasa Traders’ phone · Sarah</p>
      <div class="pcrop" style="--crop-h:420px"><div class="hphone"><div class="hscreen"><div class="app"><span class="nt"></span>
        <div class="a-sbar"><span>9:41</span><i></i></div>
        <div class="ch"><svg class="i back"><use href="#i-cl"/></svg><span class="a-av ph ph-sarah">SA</span><div><b>Sarah</b><span>On Sawaza · +256 701 552 093</span></div><svg class="i more"><use href="#i-more"/></svg></div>
        <div class="tabs"><span>Activity</span><span>Records</span><span class="on">Invoices &amp; Debts</span></div>
        <div class="owes"><b>Sarah owes you</b><strong class="num in">UGX 1,060,000</strong><span>left on 2 debts</span></div>
        <div class="a-debt"><div class="top"><b>Invoice INV-0002</b><span class="in"><small>Owes</small><strong class="num">800,000</strong></span></div><p class="ln">3 Oct · Due 31 Oct · part paid</p><p class="ln">left of UGX 1,200,000</p></div>
        <div data-key="1" class="a-debt"><div class="top"><b>Invoice INV-0003</b><span class="in"><small>Owes</small><strong class="num">260,000</strong></span></div><p class="ln">9 Oct · Due 9 Nov</p></div>
      </div></div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec deep" id="keeper"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><p class="q">Who keeps your books?</p><h2 class="h2" data-new="1">When someone else keeps your <em>books</em>.</h2><p class="lede" data-new="1">Mr Mukasa owns Mukasa Traders. Joseph minds the counter and writes the sales. One credit sale is one record: the seller holds the invoice, the buyer holds the bill.</p></div>
  <div class="trio chain">
    <div class="fig" role="img" aria-label="Step one, screen: Joseph writes a credit sale of UGX 1,200,000 to Sarah as the business and taps Record and send.">
      <p class="lab" aria-hidden="true">1 · Joseph’s phone</p>
      <div class="pcrop from-bottom" style="--crop-h:420px"><div class="hphone"><div class="hscreen"><div class="app"><span class="nt"></span><div class="a-sbar"><span>9:41</span><i></i></div>
  <div class="a-abar"><b>Mukasa Traders</b></div>
  <div class="a-scrim"></div>
  <div class="a-sheet"><i class="a-grab"></i>
    <div class="a-sht"><b>New record</b><svg class="i"><use href="#i-x"/></svg></div>
    <div class="a-body">
      <div class="a-dir"><span class="a-dp on-in"><svg class="i"><use href="#i-down"/></svg>Sale</span><span class="a-dp"><svg class="i o"><use href="#i-up"/></svg>Purchase</span></div>
      <div class="chips"><span>Paid in full</span><span class="on">On credit</span></div>
      <div data-key="1" class="a-f"><p class="a-cap">Price <em>Required</em></p><p class="a-amt in num">1,200,000</p></div>
      <div class="a-f"><p class="a-cap">Who <em class="opt">optional</em></p><div class="a-party"><span class="a-av s28 ph ph-sarah">SA</span><div><b>Sarah</b><small>On Sawaza</small></div></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="a-foot"><div class="a-share"><svg class="i"><use href="#i-ppl"/></svg><div><b>Send to Sarah</b><small>They will be asked to confirm it</small></div><span class="a-sw"></span></div><span class="a-btn">Record and send</span></div>
  </div>
</div></div></div></div>
      <p class="cap" data-new="1">Joseph writes a credit sale or a payment as the business.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fig" role="img" aria-label="Step two, screen: Sarah sees the bill from Mukasa Traders, awaiting her, with a Review button.">
      <p class="lab" aria-hidden="true">2 · Sarah’s phone</p>
      <div class="pcrop" style="--crop-h:240px"><div class="hphone"><div class="hscreen"><div class="app"><span class="nt"></span>
        <div class="a-sbar"><span>9:41</span><i></i></div>
        <div data-key="1" class="a-row wash"><span class="a-av ent">MT</span><div><div class="a-rh"><b>Mukasa Traders</b><span class="a-tm">9:12 am</span></div><div class="a-rl">Billed</div><div class="a-quote"><b>Goods</b><span class="m out held"><svg class="i"><use href="#i-up"/></svg>UGX 1,200,000</span></div><div class="a-rf"><span class="gt">Awaiting you</span><span class="a-review">Review</span></div></div></div>
      </div></div></div></div>
      <p class="cap" data-new="1">The customer signs it on their own phone.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fig" role="img" aria-label="Step three, screen: Mr Mukasa reads the books, with the sale to Sarah sealed and Agnes’s still awaiting her.">
      <p class="lab" aria-hidden="true">3 · Mr Mukasa’s phone</p>
      <div class="pcrop" style="--crop-h:340px"><div class="hphone"><div class="hscreen"><div class="app"><span class="nt"></span>
        <div class="a-sbar"><span>9:41</span><i></i></div>
        <div class="a-abar"><b>Mukasa Traders</b></div>
        <div class="a-row"><span class="a-av ph ph-sarah">SA</span><div><div class="a-rh"><b>Sarah</b><span class="a-tm">9:14 am</span></div><div class="a-rl">Invoiced</div><div class="a-quote"><b>Goods</b><span class="m in"><svg class="i"><use href="#i-down"/></svg>UGX 1,200,000</span></div><div class="a-rf"><svg class="i fill seal"><use href="#i-ver"/></svg><span class="sl">Sawa. Sealed.</span></div></div></div>
        <div data-key="1" class="a-row"><span class="a-av">AG</span><div><div class="a-rh"><b>Agnes</b><span class="a-tm">9:20 am</span></div><div class="a-rl">Invoiced</div><div class="a-quote"><b>Goods</b><span class="m in"><svg class="i"><use href="#i-down"/></svg>UGX 150,000</span></div><div class="a-rf"><span class="a-await"><svg class="i"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg>Awaiting Agnes</span></div></div></div>
      </div></div></div></div>
      <p class="cap" data-new="1">Mr Mukasa reads it in the books, sealed.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <ul class="pts one" data-new="1">
    <li>Sarah confirms the bill in the app, and from then on both sides hold the same record.</li>
    <li>Each part payment is recorded against it, and the figure left goes down on both sides.</li>
    <li>An invoice still open after its due day reads <b>Overdue</b>.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="point" data-new="1">A figure the customer signed is not just the attendant’s word. A payment he invents or shaves has no signature, and a signed record is sealed, so any change shows. Anything still <b>Awaiting</b> is plainly one side’s word.</p>
</div></section>

<section class="sec" id="kept"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><p class="q">What else is in it?</p><h2 class="h2" data-new="1">Four kinds of business, kept apart from your <em>own money</em>.</h2></div>
  <div class="kept" data-new="1">
    <p>A sole business, a company, a partnership or a cooperative each keeps its own account and books.</p>
    <ul class="pts">
      <li>Customer accounts</li>
      <li>Credit sales with a deposit</li>
      <li>Loans with a payment plan</li>
      <li>Monthly books</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="roles">Officers write and sign for the business; viewers only read. <b>In the beta each business has one admin.</b></p>
    <p>Quotations, receipts and statements are not in the beta.</p>
    <a class="tlink" href="/help#business">More in Help <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
</div></section>

